          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela atsai osi, adiya, aolagadzi, aabuduo vizuka na anjina osi amendzao kugomba handzo, andakala kondze ya hinyo mudzi dza viratu madiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.15",
