        {
          "text": "“Mimi Jesu, ndimi chivyazi chikulu cha Mfalume Daudi, na ndimi ningʼalaye dza kombezi. Mimi ndimi yehuma malaika wangu edze akuambireni mwimwi afuasi angu mambo higa garigo himu chitabuni.”",
